        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Fleshy sacs adorn the Assembled Council's form. Each round, one of these sacs bursts open to reveal a copy of a councilor from phase one at the start of the Assembled Council's turn. On the Assembled Council's first turn, three random councilors from phase one are created, instead of a single councilor.</p>\n<p>These councilors have only [[35]] hit points, and have the minion trait. Their abilities are otherwise unchanged.</p>\n<p>Once per turn, The Assembled Council may command all active councilor minions with a single free action. </p>"
