        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The Assembled Council laughs with elemental glee. Pick two @Template[type:burst|distance:10] within 60ft. Creatures in the first area take @Damage[9d6[cold]] damage, creatures in the second area take @Damage[9d6[fire]] damage, both with a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:25|basic:true].</p><p>A creature that fails its save also becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1} for 1 round if it took cold damage or @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 1} for 1 round if it took fire damage. The bursts cannot overlap. If a creature is somehow in both bursts, The Assembled Council decides by which of the two instances the creature is affected, but it can not be affected by both.</p>"
        },
