        "actions": {
          "value": 1
        },
        "category": "defensive",
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The shadows in the chamber jump from their places and claw at the eyes of the Assembled Council's foes. All enemies in the arena must make a @Check[type:will|dc:25]. On a failure, that creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} for 1 round, or 1 minute on a critical failure. Creatures within 10 feet of the Assembled Council automatically succeed on this save.</p><p>After using Swirling Darkness and resolving all of the above effects, the Assembled Council may teleport to any unoccupied location it can see within 60ft. This movement does not trigger reactions.</p>"
        },
