        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy uses an action with the auditory trait <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\">or casts a spell without the Subtle trait within The Assembled Council of Taltain's reach.</span></p><hr /><p>The Assembled Council of Tailtain makes a Slam Strike against the triggering creature, targeting their face.</p><p>On a success or critical success, the creature is stupefied 2 for 1 round.</p>"
