        },
        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><span style=\"font-family:'gg sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">The Assembled Council of Taltain can be in two Shifting Forms at once. When you use Shifting Form, roll for two different forms. It gains access to all abilities from both of those forms. A form still maybe not be used a second time until all forms have been used at least once, and it still does not have access to forms from councilors that were not present in the first phase of combat. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'gg sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">For automation purposes, make sure to select the appropriate Shifting Form in the dropdown when relevant. IE Pestilence Fangs form when you use Wild Bites for the persistent poison dropdown, and Duelist Form for the AC bonus.</span></p>"
        },
